<section class="sg-sec" id="listen"><h2>Listen</h2><div class="sg-video" data-yt="2YWcEMipnPU" data-title="Argentine National Anthem: Orquesta Sinfónica Nacional and Coro Polifónico Nacional de Argentina"><button type="button" class="sg-play"><span class="sg-play-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="sg-play-t">Play the performance</span><span class="sg-play-n">Orquesta Sinfónica Nacional and Coro Polifónico Nacional de Argentina</span></button></div><p class="sg-video-cr">On YouTube, from the channel Christian Baldini - conductor &amp; composer. Pressing play loads YouTube&#8217;s player. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2YWcEMipnPU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch on YouTube<span aria-hidden="true"> &#8599;</span></a></p></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Charge of the Gauchos</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1928</span><span class="sg-chain-h">film whose Argentine title is a line of the original anthem</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Official Story</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1985</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the anthem opens the film</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Filosofía barata y zapatos de goma (Charly García)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1990</span><span class="sg-chain-h">rock cover version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">El Grito Sagrado (various Argentine artists)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1998</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new recordings of the anthem and other patriotic songs</span></li></ul></section>
